+---
+id: task-003-validate-task-input
+type: task
+title: "Validate task input"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+
+# Validate task input
+
+Request: reject invalid input with a clear error; when input is rejected nothing in the list changes.
+
+- A title (after trimming) that is empty, or longer than 120 characters, is rejected.
+- A priority other than `low`, `normal` or `high` is rejected.
+- A tag that is empty or contains a space is rejected.
+- Applies to `add` (title, priority, tags), `rename` (title) and `tag` (tag).
+- The error is a `Result` failure with the new code `invalid-input` (r4), and a message saying what is wrong.
